{\b Thesis Master Structure and Writing Map}\par
\par
{\b Working Title}\par
Recognition, Stackability, and Student Trust in IT Micro-Credentials in Thailand: A Survey-Experimental Study of Perceived Value among Thai IT Students\par
\par
{\b Core Study Logic}\par
Thai IT students cannot directly know the future value of a micro-credential, so they infer value from visible signals such as formal recognition, stackability, and industry endorsement. These signals shape student trust, and student trust shapes perceived value.\par
